WEBVTT

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.510
This is Serena's Airgetlám?

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.250
A damaged Symphogear can never 
be incorporated into a mission.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.280
Take this.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.810
You will be

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.910
forced to carry lies into battle with you.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.260
It's a little something to keep you safe.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.750
Thank you, Mama.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.090
I'll be fine.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.500
Will I be able to shine strongly, like Serena?

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.870
Strong...

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.950
Alca-Noise!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.840
Alca-Noise signal detected!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.800
<b>Episode 4 
Gungnir, Once More</b>

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:37.840
Narrowing down the signal.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.070
Elfnein-chan's information has made

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.180
our detection ability much more precise.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.500
We'll send the wielders...

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.100
Having Shirabe-chan and Kirika-chan 
fight in their condition is reckless!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.350
And without usable Gears,

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:55.300
we can't send Tsubasa-san, 
Chris-chan, or even Maria-san!

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:00.340
Only Hibiki-kun has a functioning Gear.

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:05.340
I'll trample that ideal little 
flower garden in your head.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.490
Hibiki?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:21.930
I can't sing...

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.090
Huh?

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.350
Just give it up already.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.850
The holy words won't come to me...

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.020
Gungnir won't answer me!

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.470
She isn't refusing to sing.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:41.990
She can't?

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:43.410
Ogawa!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.670
On it!

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.050
What's going on?

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.750
I'm going to help Hibiki-san!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.130
Why won't the holy words come to me?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:04.860
<i>Without her Gear,
 there's no point in fighting her...</i>

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:09.640
<i>Maybe I should try going after 
one of her little friends?</i>

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.560
What a pain!

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.690
I don't know what your deal 
is with Tachibana.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.350
But if this is going to drag on, 
could you leave us out of it?

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.620
You aren't with her?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.890
Heck, no!

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.940
We just happened to be walking home together.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:31.620
Now, clear the way.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:40.710
Let's go!

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.100
You're brave at the weirdest of times.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.680
At last year's school fair, 
you were totally different.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.450
Was that an act back there?

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:58.520
We need to help Bikky once in a while, right?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.400
Not to brag, but I think it was a great plan.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:08.320
And now, I will crush your hopes.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:25.470
If I toss you up and slam you down, 
she might get in the mood to fight, right?

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.720
This isn't an anime!

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:34.930
My Gear!

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:54.010
<i>Granzizel bilfen Gungnir zizzl...</i>

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.820
Maria-san!

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.870
<i>As long as I have this power, I can fight.</i>

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.870
Black Gungnir...

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:43.110
Ogawa-san and Maria-san have arrived.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.800
She's engaged the enemy with Gungnir.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:45.820
Maria-kun!

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.050
The part that lights up when attacking 
is the dissection organ.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.860
Watch out for it!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.540
Unexpected event after unexpected event.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.250
The piece of junk we abandoned

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.650
is proving to greatly exceed our expectations.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.160
Maria-san is fighting

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.790
with my Gungnir.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:34.890
Even with that...

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.110
You should chill!

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:00.370
I've decided... You're my opponent.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.590
Snack time!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.520
Even so, that's all you have?

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:26.600
What is this?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.980
Not one of you can actually sing?

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.180
No one told me that.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.090
This sucks.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:43.210
Spatial teleportation...

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.080
Is that alchemy, as well?

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:51.400
If she can complete the new type 
of Noise in the modern era,

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:55.800
that means she has the technology 
to affect phase space.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.220
Forget that! Is everyone okay?

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:00.140
Maria-san went over there

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.810
and used Gungnir to drive off the enemy.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.460
What did you say?!

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.990
Does that mean that, like us...

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:13.030
She was suffering from the Symphogear's 
discord while she fought.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.850
Madness.

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.340
<i>If only I hadn't</i>

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:23.970
<i>let go of the Gungnir...</i>

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.870
<i>No, that's nothing but a regret.</i>

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:35.520
Are you hurt?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:39.300
We're fine. But you're a mess...

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.930
You fought, sang, and got so hurt.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.320
Are you okay?

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:46.890
Your Gungnir—

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.460
This is my Gungnir!

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:48.810
Hibiki!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:51.920
This power is supposed to save people!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.310
I was the one who got it! It's my Gungnir!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.470
I'm sorry.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.370
Are you running away?

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.590
I don't think I'm running away!

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:13.130
But...

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:17.930
Ever since I realized that the Gungnir 
is really my own power,

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:21.600
I've hated the idea of hurting 
someone with a power

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.010
that should be used to help them.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.060
That's right.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.490
Gungnir is your power.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:32.190
So don't avert your eyes from it!

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.590
Don't avert my eyes?

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:48.370
Garie...

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:51.250
Please don't make that face!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.330
One couldn't sing,

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:56.600
and the other sang, but couldn't do anything...

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:01.010
Ripping those songs away 
wouldn't do us any good at all.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:05.620
If you haven't forgotten the reason 
for your creation, that's fine.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:12.270
I don't want to fight using a power 
that's meant to save people...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.770
Then you'll try to save people 
and get killed, too?!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:22.280
But next time, stop and destroy her songs.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.130
Any further delay will affect the plan.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.640
The unleashing of the ley lines...

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.120
I understand, of course.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.500
Leave it to me!

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:36.140
I'll give you Micha. 
She's specifically optimized for combat.

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:37.000
Got it?

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.260
I'm ready to go.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.260
Don't tell her that!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:46.190
<i>If only that failure of a wielder's 
Gear hadn't been disabled...</i>

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:53.730
You can't sleep?

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.770
Sorry... I'm making you worry.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:00.780
You're thinking about today, aren't you?

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.330
I can't fight.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.280
I'm so scared

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.450
of singing and hurting someone 
with my own hands.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.730
My weakness put you all in danger.

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:14.610
But...

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.620
I know that your songs

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:27.190
don't exist to hurt anyone.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.030
Mama, I'm sorry that we're late.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:42.870
This is the taste of Japan you love!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.030
I was opposed to it,

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:47.990
but Kiri-chan has more common sense 
than I do, and she insisted.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:51.370
The piece of Frontier that returned with you

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.380
and the data on the lunar ruins

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:56.120
are being investigated by 
organizations worldwide.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:13:00.500
We're trying to research them together 
and use them to help people!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.180
It's taking time,

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:05.030
but it looks like the world is 
changing, little by little.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.650
<i>It isn't only the world that's trying to change.</i>

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.140
<i>But I'm the only one that's...</i>

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.250
<i>The Airgetlám that fought the Nephilim,</i>

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.400
<i>and the Gungnir that I wore again...</i>

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.900
<i>It's always a power other than my own</i>

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.220
<i>that gets me through the tough spots.</i>

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.510
I want to change, too.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:27.360
I want to be strong in the truest sense.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.950
It isn't only you.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.080
We feel the same way.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.120
<b>Kikukoman</b>

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:40.360
You won't scold me
 like you used to, will you?

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.480
It's okay, Mama.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.800
I'll find the answer myself.

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:48.700
This is the world you left us.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.110
All the answers must be here.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:03.410
Is Tachibana-san not going to eat?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.130
She says she has homework.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:09.190
Putting homework over lunch?

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:11.410
Then she's in pretty bad shape.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.500
A Bikky who can't sing, huh?

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.640
If we try to cheer her up, she'll probably be

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.640
more concerned about making us feel better.

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:21.290
Normally, she's so simple,

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.630
but at times like this, she gets complicated.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:27.470
Do you think the reason she can't sing

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.300
is that she's forgotten the reason she sings?

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:34.060
The reason she sings?

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.180
Yeah.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.100
If she remembers that, I'm sure...

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:40.980
Hibiki will be able to sing again.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:50.480
Garie, the one who attacked 
Hibiki-san a few days ago,

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.620
and Leiur, the one who fought Chris-san.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:56.000
There's also Phara, whom Tsubasa-san saw in London.

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:59.100
And Micha, whom you haven't seen yet.

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:01.750
These are the Autoscorers Carol uses.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.630
So we can't even handle playing with her dolls?

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.380
Then these mechanical dolls

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.260
are like knights guarding a princess?

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:14.730
Their details, including specifications,

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.490
are not recorded in me.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.570
But...

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.230
Given their ability to overcome 
a Symphogear in battle,

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.650
there's no doubt about it.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:26.280
Our job is dealing with supernatural threats.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.910
Elfnein-kun has proposed a plan

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.610
to handle this situation.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:40.280
Project Ignite.

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:51.260
Are you still afraid to sing?

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:53.190
Yeah.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.550
When I think that I might hurt someone, yeah.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.290
Do you remember the first time

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.980
you used a Symphogear, Hibiki?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.750
I don't know...

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.520
When I did, I wasn't thinking anything.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.600
Back then,

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:13.160
did you sing because you 
wanted to hurt someone?

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.410
The Ignite Module...

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.670
Is this really possible?

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.370
Theoretically, it's possible

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.420
via the application of alchemy.

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.920
Taking a great risk to gain a great reward.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:34.600
That is what the magic sword Dáinsleif is for.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.180
Alca-Noise signal detected!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:43.060
Location identified. Putting on monitor!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:48.440
At last, Micha has been activated, as well.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.950
I want you to stop running and sing!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:00.330
Or are you leading me someplace 
where it's easier to sing?

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.830
Then I want you to say so.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:07.470
Go!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.720
An enemy attack?

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.630
But from where we are now...

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:19.970
...we won't make it!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:28.020
Hibiki!

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:33.700
Miku...

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.940
If you don't give up and start fighting,

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.540
I'm going to dissect the things you love.

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:44.750
If you won't fight when your 
friend is being ripped apart,

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.210
I'll dissect the townspeople,

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:49.840
and even the dogs and cats!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.920
If you won't get serious...

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.240
Listen, Hibiki!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.900
Your songs don't exist to hurt people!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.190
And I know the hand

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:25.230
you extended to me isn't there to hurt anyone!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:27.250
I know because of who I am.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.210
Because I fought you,

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:31.880
and you saved me!

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.630
Not just me...

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.670
There are many people who 
were saved by your songs,

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.390
and are only here today because of them!

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:42.390
So don't be afraid!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.520
Gotcha!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:19:02.860
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron!</i>

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.340
I love your songs...

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:17.680
Sing them for everyone...

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:32.630
I'm sorry.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:36.860
I was running from this power 
and its responsibility.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.270
But I won't hesitate anymore.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.360
So listen to my songs!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.370
She really is a hopeless dummy.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.290
Here I go.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.450
I'll be waiting.

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:58.060
<i>A right hand, resolved to break through,</i>

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.190
Here!

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:03.720
<i>as the sound that I am resounds.</i>

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:09.430
<i>The courage to carry you beyond how or why,</i>

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:14.290
<i>clutched in an unwavering fist.</i>

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:15.370
<i>Be brave! Let's shout!</i>

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:18.360
This will be worth crushing!

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:19.920
<i>Just keep moving forward.</i>

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:23.200
These are the specs of an Autoscorer 
specialized for combat.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.370
<i>Reach them! Let's shout!</i>

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:25.660
<i>You're the type to give it everything you've got.</i>

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:25.850
Even if it is specialized for combat,

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:28.410
<i>Break through the walls, 
break through with my heart.</i>

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:29.200
it's impossible for Tachibana to lose.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.010
<i>As long as there's a song in my heart,</i>

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:33.830
<i>believing in justice and clutching tight.</i>

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:39.090
<i>Be a flower, blooming in your own color!</i>

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.260
<i>Don't be a hero, just be loud!</i>

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.840
<i>G-Beat, max out.</i>

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.500
<i>G-Beat, the meter.</i>

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:01.110
Too bad... That was an illusion 
reflected in the water.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.720
Hibiki!

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.230
Hibiki!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.730
Hibiki! Hibiki!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:50.120
No! Hibiki!

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:54.120
Please! Wake up! Hibiki!

00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:56.710
Hibiki!

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:35.890
The Autoscorers are withdrawing!

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:37.560
Get Hibiki-chan out of there!

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:38.740
I'll head out immediately.

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:41.290
We can handle it!

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:44.010
So please move forward with Project Ignite!

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.510
The completion of the enhanced Symphogears!
